==English==
[[Image:Cyclic quadrilateral.svg|thumb|Various '''circumscribed''' [[quadrilateral]]s: note the circles.]]

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|circumscribo|circumscrībō|lang=la}} from {{term|circum||around|lang=la}} + {{term|scribo|scrībō|write|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˈsɜː.kəm.skɹaɪb/}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˈsɝ.kəm.skɹaɪb/}}
* {{audio|en-us-circumscribe.ogg|Audio (US)}}
* {{rhymes|aɪb}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|circumscrib|ing}}

# To [[draw]] a line [[around]]; to [[encircle]].
# To [[limit]] narrowly; to [[restrict]].
# {{geometry}} To draw the [[small]]est [[circle]] or higher-dimensional [[sphere]] that has (a polyhedron, polygon, etc.) in its interior.

